<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan seeks 6,000 T palm oil, 3,000 T olein.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 6,000 T palm oil, 3,000 T olein.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) tendered on Tuesday for 6,000 tonnes of RBD palm oil and 3,000 tonnes of palm olein for shipment by October 10, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said bids would be opened at 0630 GMT the same day.</p>
<p>The TCP was buying on behalf of the state-run Ghee Corporation of Pakistan (GCP), one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
